    "hmac-verified-before-any-work": "backend/webhook_receiver/validator.py's signature check runs and passes before backend/webhook_receiver/router.py enqueues a job or invokes any handler; verify by tracing that every code path reaching job_queue.enqueue() in the webhook handler is preceded by a successful validate_signature() call, and that no other entry point can reach enqueue() for GitHub events.",
    "budget-guard-hard-blocks": "backend/economics/budget.py's BudgetGuard.check() is called at the start of every specialist agent node in backend/orchestrator/nodes.py, and raises/short-circuits the node before any call into backend/tools/llm_client.py once the day's cost (read from the agent_health_1m rollup or its local-dev equivalent) exceeds the configured daily cap; verify no orchestrator node calls llm_client without a preceding BudgetGuard.check() in the same function body.",
